    "run_id": "00724fc31c51461c863c560d0496088c",
    "answer": "2018-07-01 的 delivered_monthly_gmv 为 867953.46，比较期 2018-06-01 为 856077.86，绝对变化为 11875.60。相对变化为 1.3872%。两期通过本次完整性检查，可作标准期间比较。",
    "sql": {
      "statement": "SELECT substr(o.order_purchase_timestamp, 1, 7) || '-01' AS purchase_month,\n       SUM(i.price) AS monthly_gmv\nFROM fact_orders AS o\nJOIN fact_order_items AS i ON i.order_id = o.order_id\nWHERE o.order_status = 'delivered'\n  AND o.order_purchase_timestamp >= :start_date\n  AND o.order_purchase_timestamp < :end_date_exclusive\nGROUP BY substr(o.order_purchase_timestamp, 1, 7)\nORDER BY purchase_month",
      "parameters": {
        "start_date": "2018-06-01",
        "end_date_exclusive": "2018-08-01"
      },
